<title>USA: South Orange BOE, N.J., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>South Orange BOE, N.J., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter said it won $13.712 million of South Orange and Maplewood SD BOE, N.J., school bonds.</p>
